{"content":"{\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-12-6:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_12_6\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[],\"blocks\":[{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_12_6:001\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"本章描述本研究的数据治理与计算机化系统安排，覆盖系统角色与职责、访问控制、记录完整性、验证状态和变更管理。数据治理与计算机化系统的实际角色、记录、协议和适用安排需由项目事实补齐；本批次引入的数据管理与伦理相关新事实根为项目实例事实，归属共享事实命名空间，由 StudyDefinition 统一承载，本载体不建立章内第二可编辑存储。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance\"},{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_12_6:002\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"数据治理责任按项目角色划分：明确研究者、授权研究者、数据管理员、统计师、监查员、系统管理员、稽查员和申办者代表的系统角色与职责；角色权限与其职责匹配，关键操作分离。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.system_roles\"},{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_12_6:003\",\"kind\":\"table\",\"table\":{\"table_id\":\"tbl:v2_n_12_6:governance\",\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_12_6:003\",\"schema_version\":\"structured_table_v1\",\"domain\":\"generic\",\"role\":\"body_content\",\"review_state\":\"ai_draft\",\"title\":\"数据治理与计算机化系统治理安排\",\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance\",\"header_row_count\":1,\"columns\":[{\"column_id\":\"col:governance_area\",\"order\":0,\"label\":\"治理领域\",\"semantic_role\":\"governance_area\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"column_id\":\"col:system_record\",\"order\":1,\"label\":\"系统记录与控制\",\"semantic_role\":\"system_record\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"column_id\":\"col:governance_owner\",\"order\":2,\"label\":\"治理负责人/职责\",\"semantic_role\":\"governance_owner\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"source_locator\":\"\"}],\"rows\":[{\"row_id\":\"row:header\",\"order\":0,\"style_role\":\"header\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:header_area\",\"row_id\":\"row:header\",\"column_id\":\"col:governance_area\",\"text\":\"治理领域\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:header_system_record\",\"row_id\":\"row:header\",\"column_id\":\"col:system_record\",\"text\":\"系统记录与控制\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:header_governance_owner\",\"row_id\":\"row:header\",\"column_id\":\"col:governance_owner\",\"text\":\"治理负责人/职责\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:system_roles\",\"order\":1,\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.system_roles\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:system_roles_area\",\"row_id\":\"row:system_roles\",\"column_id\":\"col:governance_area\",\"text\":\"系统角色与职责\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.system_roles\"},{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:system_record\",\"row_id\":\"row:system_roles\",\"column_id\":\"col:system_record\",\"text\":\"明确研究者、授权研究者、数据管理员、统计师、监查员、系统管理员、稽查员和申办者代表的系统角色与职责；角色权限与其职责匹配，关键操作分离。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.system_roles\"},{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:governance_owner\",\"row_id\":\"row:system_roles\",\"column_id\":\"col:governance_owner\",\"text\":\"研究者、授权研究者、数据管理员、统计师、监查员、系统管理员、稽查员和申办者代表按已明确职责承担相应角色责任；角色权限与其职责匹配，关键操作分离。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.system_roles\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:access_controls\",\"order\":2,\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.access_controls\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:access_controls_area\",\"row_id\":\"row:access_controls\",\"column_id\":\"col:governance_area\",\"text\":\"访问控制\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.access_controls\"},{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:access_controls_record\",\"row_id\":\"row:access_controls\",\"column_id\":\"col:system_record\",\"text\":\"计算机化系统采用基于角色的访问控制、唯一用户账号、强密码或多因素认证及权限最小化原则；权限授予、变更和撤销均需授权并记录，定期复核。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.access_controls\"},{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:access_controls_owner\",\"row_id\":\"row:access_controls\",\"column_id\":\"col:governance_owner\",\"text\":\"权限授予、变更和撤销均需授权并记录，定期复核；项目角色按职责执行授权与复核记录。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.access_controls\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:validation_status\",\"order\":3,\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.validation_status\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:validation_status_area\",\"row_id\":\"row:validation_status\",\"column_id\":\"col:governance_area\",\"text\":\"验证状态\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.validation_status\"},{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:validation_status_record\",\"row_id\":\"row:validation_status\",\"column_id\":\"col:system_record\",\"text\":\"用于本研究的计算机化系统在投入使用前完成基于风险的验证，并保持验证状态；验证计划、风险评估、测试脚本、偏差处理和验证总结报告归档备查。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.validation_status\"},{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:validation_status_owner\",\"row_id\":\"row:validation_status\",\"column_id\":\"col:governance_owner\",\"text\":\"验证计划、风险评估、测试脚本、偏差处理和验证总结报告归档备查；验证状态保持。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.validation_status\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:record_integrity\",\"order\":4,\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.record_integrity\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:record_integrity_area\",\"row_id\":\"row:record_integrity\",\"column_id\":\"col:governance_area\",\"text\":\"记录完整性\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.record_integrity\"},{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:record_integrity_record\",\"row_id\":\"row:record_integrity\",\"column_id\":\"col:system_record\",\"text\":\"数据治理遵循ALCOA+原则，确保数据可归属、清晰、同步、原始、准确、完整、一致、持久和可获取；电子记录与签名符合适用法规要求。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.record_integrity\"},{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:record_integrity_owner\",\"row_id\":\"row:record_integrity\",\"column_id\":\"col:governance_owner\",\"text\":\"电子记录与签名符合适用法规要求；记录完整性由项目角色按职责维护，并保留可追溯记录。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.record_integrity\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:change_management\",\"order\":5,\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.change_management\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:change_management_area\",\"row_id\":\"row:change_management\",\"column_id\":\"col:governance_area\",\"text\":\"变更管理\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.change_management\"},{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:change_management_record\",\"row_id\":\"row:change_management\",\"column_id\":\"col:system_record\",\"text\":\"系统变更须经变更申请、风险评估、验证或测试、批准和发布流程；紧急变更事后补审。变更记录、测试证据和版本历史归档保存，确保可追溯。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.change_management\"},{\"cell_id\":\"data:cell:change_management_owner\",\"row_id\":\"row:change_management\",\"column_id\":\"col:governance_owner\",\"text\":\"变更记录、测试证据和版本历史归档保存，确保可追溯；紧急变更事后补审。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.change_management\"}]}],\"notes\":[{\"note_id\":\"note:v2_n_12_6:table-1\",\"note_type\":\"operational\",\"text\":\"本表仅使用已确认研究事实；缺失事实进入待补/建议解决路径，不以不适用替代强制内容。本表涉及试验参与者相关安排时，合成测试值仅用于结构校验，不构成项目批准。\",\"source_refs\":[],\"marker\":\"\",\"marker_source_locator\":\"\",\"association_reason\":\"数据治理事实边界\",\"target_ids\":[\"tbl:v2_n_12_6:governance\"],\"module_ref\":\"\",\"project_override\":false,\"review_status\":\"ai_draft\",\"source_kind\":\"\"}],\"word_layout\":{\"bookmark\":\"_Toc9900003\",\"style_id\":\"3\"},\"version\":0}},{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_12_6:004\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"计算机化系统采用基于角色的访问控制、唯一用户账号、强密码或多因素认证及权限最小化原则；权限授予、变更和撤销均需授权并记录，定期复核。数据治理遵循ALCOA+原则，确保数据可归属、清晰、同步、原始、准确、完整、一致、持久和可获取；电子记录与签名符合适用法规要求。用于本研究的计算机化系统在投入使用前完成基于风险的验证，并保持验证状态；验证计划、风险评估、测试脚本、偏差处理和验证总结报告归档备查。系统变更须经变更申请、风险评估、验证或测试、批准和发布流程；紧急变更事后补审。变更记录、测试证据和版本历史归档保存，确保可追溯。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.access_controls; chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.record_integrity; chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.validation_status; chapter_input.resolved_facts.data_governance.change_management\"},{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_12_6:005\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"伦理、隐私、未来使用和补偿安排等事项如属于本章范围而未在本批次已确认事实中提供，应进入待补/建议解决路径；本候选不将其判定为不适用，也不以模板示例或未确认安排替代项目事实。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"chapter_contract.positive_qc_rules.qc:v2-n-12-6:semantic-closure\"}]}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"705fc3e0babb67fbc3fdabc9f069431e705289de509313f4895166c37ea12b54"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:cb9b6e2b3dd300cf974e3fa65fe376ab678b87e937a1a6ec3e704559276d7238:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:cb9b6e2b3dd300cf974e3fa65fe376ab678b87e937a1a6ec3e704559276d7238:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"c68e904b759effbee4c9c2c5b3e11bf6ccdbcb9818470b3f626461d13ecd8cd3","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c83431941196